antart.com/citrusanime/art/My-Offical-DA-Mascot-290687270\n\n他のアーティスト 1. https://sta.sh/023ht6z36vqf 2. https://sta.sh/0278r2mg6ixd 3. https://sta.sh/0k1ja8v3adq\n\nポーズの参考文献 1. https://sta.sh/0ufsyy8di0d 2. https://sta.sh/0sozjsty4p7 3. https://sta.sh/01hzsy3ciyyy\n\nセクシーに描いてください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gyokuourou4414/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cfde4e1f/uploads/origins/451fbb66-a542-4bcf-aaac-0d9d118f1875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=405dbb4641b25a333e6291db8e44538d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cfde4e1f/uploads/origins/451fbb66-a542-4bcf-aaac-0d9d118f1875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=405dbb4641b25a333e6291db8e44538d, https://si.imgix.net/cfde4e1f/uploads/origins/451fbb66-a542-4bcf-aaac-0d9d118f1875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0f508646f12e996beee30b43c58cdba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cfde4e1f/uploads/origins/451fbb66-a542-4bcf-aaac-0d9d118f1875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5c2656f37aa821816bf9ee9f602361e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\"奇跡のクエスト \"の \"ステラ \"の絵をお願いします。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nxSurpHU4p-OVKi3cSfU3iVzfjC2GaLG?usp=sharing\nチアガール姿のステラが、慌てたり照れたりしながら応援している姿が見たいです。ありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gyokuourou4414/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/189076b8/uploads/origins/5e391b15-bee9-4c57-abbe-a231351d21f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ec8880f079cfe8f54204ddb2b94be01", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/189076b8/uploads/origins/5e391b15-bee9-4c57-abbe-a231351d21f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ec8880f079cfe8f54204ddb2b94be01, https://si.imgix.net/189076b8/uploads/origins/5e391b15-bee9-4c57-abbe-a231351d21f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=805a2c653a714a73d256281313e91178 2x, https://si.imgix.net/189076b8/uploads/origins/5e391b15-bee9-4c57-abbe-a231351d21f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20d5a87b944b7efbad8c3c293a964cad 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nお元気でお過ごしでしょうか！\nリクエストなのですが、ナズーリンがかわいい水着を着ているところを描いていただけませんか？\n全てお任せします！\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nHello!\nI hope you are doing well!\nFor my request, would you be able to draw Nazrin wearing cute swimwear?\nI'll leave everything up to you!\nThank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gyokuourou4414/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1e82e1de/uploads/origins/106b938f-cd37-4816-bd2b-ef8a251d6430?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=500de617b33cfbfa4267df64feb98ccc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1e82e1de/uploads/origins/106b938f-cd37-4816-bd2b-ef8a251d6430?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=500de617b33cfbfa4267df64feb98ccc, https://si.imgix.net/1e82e1de/uploads/origins/106b938f-cd37-4816-bd2b-ef8a251d6430?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1bd6b7da6a4e128b9552b1c3abc758c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1e82e1de/uploads/origins/106b938f-cd37-4816-bd2b-ef8a251d6430?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=548d3de2cb9f57cbed00692be7d17924 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！いつも絵を見させていただいております。\nさっそくですが、東方projectの射命丸文を、いわゆる香霖堂天狗装束でお願いしたいです。\n表情は微笑で、下半身も入るように描いて欲しいです。前垂れがたなびいて、下着は見えていなくて、太ももは鼠蹊部が見えるぐらい大胆に描いてくださると嬉しいです。\nその他のことはお任せします。どうぞ宜しくご検討ください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gyokuourou4414/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e87a303/uploads/origins/a4b09e45-bf77-4382-bff6-88a88bad92f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab4cdcded5b09fa39812a8da79cd8ff8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e87a303/uploads/origins/a4b09e45-bf77-4382-bff6-88a88bad92f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab4cdcded5b09fa39812a8da79cd8ff8, https://si.imgix.net/4e87a303/uploads/origins/a4b09e45-bf77-4382-bff6-88a88bad92f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=219ead198b1c9172ed6a4c5d84bc7197 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e87a303/uploads/origins/a4b09e45-bf77-4382-bff6-88a88bad92f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=297a14d65dad6d25234e2a0b7b7b6fbb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のキャラクター、イージスを描いてくれませんか。\n好きなように描いてください。\n\nお願いを聞いてくれてありがとう。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1D4kgTWvJrEMmwBgmshtCnvffhoLodwGC/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gyokuourou4414/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f29258e/uploads/origins/a64283c3-8c59-43cf-bfe8-7a03db59d831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f5920b6cf1149dd1238b4069a4e77c7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f29258e/uploads/origins/a64283c3-8c59-43cf-bfe8-7a03db59d831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f5920b6cf1149dd1238b4069a4e77c7, https://si.imgix.net/7f29258e/uploads/origins/a64283c3-8c59-43cf-bfe8-7a03db59d831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0aef412cb8dcc85121f1c4960c7864d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f29258e/uploads/origins/a64283c3-8c59-43cf-bfe8-7a03db59d831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74f7a3cc3cd63960f8ef15cec5662ba3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nI hope you are doing well!\nWould you like to draw Nazrin again?\nIf so, please draw Nazrin with a Summer theme!\nI'll leave everything up to you!\nThank you very much!\n\nこんにちは！\nお元気ですか？\nまたナズーリンを描きませんか？\nその時は夏をテーマにナズーリンを描いてください！\n全てお任せします！\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gyokuourou4414/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b4e7d9b/uploads/origins/8e7cdd9b-ae5b-47f6-8364-3aa33830c73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23438371d80d1ee3dc5da2be85bb9592", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b4e7d9b/uploads/origins/8e7cdd9b-ae5b-47f6-8364-3aa33830c73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23438371d80d1ee3dc5da2be85bb9592, https://si.imgix.net/6b4e7d9b/uploads/origins/8e7cdd9b-ae5b-47f6-8364-3aa33830c73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c695d57826f85f518544899768c13f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6b4e7d9b/uploads/origins/8e7cdd9b-ae5b-47f6-8364-3aa33830c73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53a1015d9275c38d0b744b56744ea6b6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nI hope you are doing well!\nThank you for all your wonderful Nazrin illustrations!\nFor my next request, can you please draw a cute Nazrin in any outfit of your choosing?\nI’ll leave everything up to you!\nThank you very much!\n\nこんにちは！\nお元気ですか？\nいつも素敵なナズーリンのイラストをありがとうございます！\n次回のリクエストは、好きな服を着たかわいいナズーリンを描いていただけませんか？\n全てお任せします！\nありがとうございました", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gyokuourou4414/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/26fe6b4e/uploads/origins/62f4b4b4-06da-4b35-827d-ac7c0d6eb8b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b031c85b0311e4d76ee7ef78fa6cd0f4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/26fe6b4e/uploads/origins/62f4b4b4-06da-4b35-827d-ac7c0d6eb8b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b031c85b0311e4d76ee7ef78fa6cd0f4, https://si.imgix.net/26fe6b4e/uploads/origins/62f4b4b4-06da-4b35-827d-ac7c0d6eb8b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34cf42c78bc422efd39e9ba0071610f6 2x, https: